/*!
\page p_vpl_header_structure VPL Header Structure

By default, including \c rw/math/math.h will automatically include the VPL.
For course, this also includes that math library.  If you would like to improve
build times, you can include other headers provided for the VPL.

\c rw/math/vpl.h - Includes all of the VPL (but doesn't include the rest of math).

\c rw/math/vpl/float_operation.h - Includes floating point (both \c float and \c double) operations only.

\c rw/math/vpl/vec_operation.h - Includes vector intrinsic operations only.

\c rw/math/vpl/mem_operation.h - Includes memory operations only (e.g. memory prefetching).

*/
